Z||000000||windy28||10-06-2001||10:33 AM||||Just had a clutch put in a '85 GT 4spd. They couldn't get it to work the first time dropped the engine again, finally installed a longer threaded rod just to get the car out of the shop. I put the original clutch rod back in, installed a new slave and rebuilt the master, the rod will only move about 3/4". I can't get the clutch to release. HELP ANYONE.<P>windy28 :&gt;(  ||||reg||8
